Run the checks from .github/workflows/ci.yml locally

Usage: cargo xtask ci [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --fast
          Skip coverage, fuzz, docs, the book build, feature-powerset, msrv, package, sign-test and server-image

  -h, --help
          Print help
